OL,5,G1500 The African Queen (1952)
OL,6,     FDuring WWI in East Africa, a
OL,7,     Fseasoned riverboat captain and a
OL,8,     Fdetermined missionary risk
OL,9,     Feverything on a perilous mission
OL,10,     Fto destroy a German gunship.
